WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.120
Two important tips for you.

2
00:00:02.120 --> 00:00:04.440
If you have vomited tonight don't worry.

3
00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:06.440
You didn't vomit your entire prep,

4
00:00:06.440 --> 00:00:08.400
just take extra time drinking it.

5
00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:12.200
But if you feel you have not had a bowel movement since starting your prep or you feel

6
00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:17.000
you won't be cleaned out by the morning then I recommend you call your doctor's office.

7
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:19.940
They will most likely ask you to drink a bottle of magnesium citrate.
